<title>USA: GOLF-LEADERBOARD IN SECOND ROUND AT U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADERBOARD IN SECOND ROUND AT U.S. OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaderboard for the second round of the U.S. Open golf championship at Congressional Country Club on Friday (U.S. unless noted)</p>
<p>Forty-five players were unable to finish Friday because of a suspension of play in the middle of the round):</p>
<p> Tom Lehman			    3 under (through 18)</p>
